## Core Service Offerings

### Memory & High-Speed Interfaces
**Headline:** High-speed memory and serial interfaces, routed at the edge of physics.

**Intro:** Qmax Systems designs PCB layouts for the leading edge of digital signaling - DDR5/LPDDR5, PCIe Gen5/Gen6, and 112G SerDes - validated against the tightest timing and loss budgets in the industry.

**Applications:** AI GPU chassis · O-RAN distributed units · Server motherboards · Network interface cards · FPGA-based imaging

### Advanced HDI & Fabrication
**Headline:** Complex interconnect structures for the densest digital designs.

**Intro:** Qmax Systems masters advanced HDI fabrication - Type I, II, and III structures with stacked and staggered microvias, via-in-pad, and ELIC - to maximize routing density while preserving signal integrity.

**Applications:** High-density server boards · Multi-chip module substrates · Advanced networking equipment

### Stackup & Material Selection
**Headline:** Rigorous stackup optimization balancing electrical performance with fabrication yield.

**Intro:** Qmax Systems performs rigorous stackup optimization to balance electrical performance against fabrication yield. Engineers select ultra-low-loss laminates (Megtron 6/7, Tachyon 100G) and HVLP copper for 28+ layer PCBs.

**Applications:** 28+ layer PCBs · Controlled-impedance backplanes · Mixed-dielectric hybrid stackups

### SI/PI/EMI Simulation
**Headline:** Simulation-driven workflow — never guess-and-check.

**Intro:** Qmax Systems runs pre- and post-layout simulation in Cadence Sigrity and Ansys SIwave, covering signal integrity, power integrity, and EMI for every high-speed design.

**Tools:** Cadence Sigrity · Ansys SIwave · Full-wave EM extraction

